The SM121 CUTLASS MXFP4 kernels are built from the FlashInfer fork at
https://github.com/christopherowen/flashinfer (see containers/Dockerfile for
the pinned revision), which derives from FlashInfer (Apache-2.0) and NVIDIA
CUTLASS (BSD-3-Clause). No kernel sources are redistributed in this
repository; the container fetches them at build time.

Model weights (openai/gpt-oss-120b) and the speculative decoding head
(nvidia/gpt-oss-120b-Eagle3-v3) are not part of this repository or its
container image and remain under their own licenses.
